# APEX 官方 MCP (CGC Central MCP Server)

## 概述

CGC Central MCP Server 是 AMD CGC 团队官方维护的统一 MCP 服务，提供 APEX、Snowflake 等工具的共享 auth + tools 层。任何 MCP agent 通过一个 endpoint 即可访问全部工具目录。

- **Endpoint**: `https://cgc-mcp.amd.com/mcp`
- **官网**: https://cgc-mcp.amd.com/
- **Tools 目录**: https://cgc-mcp.amd.com/tools.html
- **GitHub**: https://github.com/AMDCS/cgc-mcp-server
- **技术栈**: FastMCP

> 本服务替代旧版 `testman-apex.amd.com:5001/5002` 双 Server（SOAP + REST）个人方案。

## 我的 MCP 配置

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "vertex": {
      "url": "http://cgc-mcp.amd.com/mcp",
      "headers": {
        "Authorization": "Bearer <YOUR_VERTEX_MCP_TOKEN>"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

Token 来源: vertex.amd.com → Settings → MCP Access → Generate Personal Access Token

## 官方公告

> Hi APEX users,
>
> Direct REST API access to APEX is now available. You can programmatically start workflows, check workflow execution status, and cancel executions.
>
> **How to get started:**
> 1. Generate a Personal Access Token at vertex.amd.com (Profile icon > Settings > MCP Access > Generate Token)
> 2. See the [APEX Web Public APIs](https://amd.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CEA/pages/1734931485/APEX+Web+Public+APIs) page for endpoint details and examples.
>
> MCP connection was enabled on **July 8th, 2026**. See the [CGC MCP page](https://cgc-mcp.amd.com/) for the list of available MCP tools.
>
> If you have questions, please contact the APEX team at dl.cgc.AutoArch@amd.com.

## REST API (Direct HTTPS Access)

除了 MCP 工具，APEX 还提供了直接的 REST API 访问。

- **Base URL**: `https://api6.amd.com`
- **认证**: `Authorization: Bearer vmcp_…` (同一个 Vertex PAT)
- **Rate Limit**: 30 requests / 60 seconds / user
- **文档**: https://amd.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CEA/pages/1734931485/APEX+Web+Public+APIs

### 可用 Endpoints
